ondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"content": "engenn6le02ob01re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Adverbs of Manner", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use adverbs of manner when you want to describe how something is done.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Example:<br /> <span class=\"italic\"> She strongly voiced her concerns.</span><br />  <span class=\"italic\">How did she voice her concerns? Strongly.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Most of the adverbs are formed by adding <span class=\"italic\">-ly </span>to an adjective. <br />  Examples: <br />strong \u2192 strongly   &nbsp; &nbsp;    loud \u2192 loudly ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Some adverbs are formed by adding <span class=\"italic\">-ally </span>. <br />Example:<br /> <span class=\"italic\">normal \u2192 normally</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Adverbs can come after the direct object or after the verb, if there isn't any direct object. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Examples:<br /> <span class=\"italic\"> She strongly campaigned against the use of landmines and so many countries banned their use.</span> <br> <span class=\"italic\">She immediately became interested in charities and important causes, drawing public focus.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "For intransitive verbs, the adverb of manner comes immediately after the verb. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Examples:<br /> <span class=\"italic\">The town grew quickly.</span><br />  <span class=\"italic\">She waited patiently. </span>", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Superlatives", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use a superlative adjective to express the highest degree of a quality. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You use it to talk about one thing or person in a group of things.   </p>The structure of the regular superlative is:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Adjective\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Superlative\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Form\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"young </br>old</br> big</br> tall\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"youngest</br> oldest</br> biggest</br> tallest\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Most adjectives: </p>+ -est\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"photographed</br>  beautiful\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"most photographed</br> most beautiful\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"3+-syllable adjectives:</p>  most + adjective\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"good</br> bad\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"the best </br>the worst\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Irregular comparisons\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "Remember you add <span class=\"strong\">the</span> in front of the superlative form to describe people, places and things.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Princess Diana was one of the tallest princesses. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "She was the most photographed. ", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "upbringing", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the way that your parents care for you and teach you to behave when you are growing up", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Lady Diana Spencer had a fairly normal upbringing out of the public eye.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le02ob01aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you can use to talk about people you admire.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "princess ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a female member of the royal family, or a woman who marries a prince", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: She was a British princess.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le02ob01aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "glamor", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the quality of being connected with wealth and success", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Her life did nothing to prepare her for the fame and glamor that being a British princess brought with it. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le02ob01aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "fame", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the state of being known by a lot of people ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  She lived a life of fame as the princess.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le02ob01aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "shy ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "feeling nervous or uncomfortable around new people", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: She was a shy young girl.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le02ob01aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "natural", "type": "name"}, {"content": "something you were born with ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Her natural beauty amazed people.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le02ob01aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "charming", "type": "name"}, {"content": "very pleasing or attractive", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: She has a charming personality.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le02ob01aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to campaign", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to take part in a series of actions intended to achieve a specific result", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: She campaigned to get rid of landmines.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le02ob01aud08", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Go on the Internet. Do some research about princesses in different countries.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Choose one of the princesses.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Fill out the table below about them.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Using the information from the table, write a 7 to 9 sentence paragraph about a princess. Write a sentences for each of the adjectives you wrote down.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Proofread your paragraph. <br><br><br><br><br><br><br>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Name:\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Nicknames:\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Location:\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Adjectives to describe them:\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Events:\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I describe a princess.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write about events in their life.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write a paragraph about a person.", "type": "text"}]}]}